<title>POLAND: NEXT POLISH CENTRAL BANK KKOOR MEETING ON DEC 9.</title>
<headline>NEXT POLISH CENTRAL BANK KKOOR MEETING ON DEC 9.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland's open market committee (KKOOR) will hold its next meeting on December 9, the central bank said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>At the KKOOR's the meeting it will set the reserve money target for December. KKOOR did not meet this week according to its fortnightly schedule.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
